q q 1 0 0 1 42 724 cm .011765 .411765 .631373 rg BT 16 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (5. Key Engineering Observations & Analysis)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 36 643 cm .92549 .992157 .960784 rg 0 76 540 -76 re f* q 1 0 0 1 8 5 cm .086275 .396078 .203922 rg BT 11 TL/F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 58 Tm (SUMMARY OF EXPERIMENTAL OBSERVATIONS:)Tj/F1 8 Tf ( 1. )Tj/F2 8 Tf (GPG Modernization:)Tj/F1 8 Tf ( Legacy `apt-key` usage creates system-wide security risks; modern)Tj T* (Ubuntu keyrings isolate repository signing keys.)Tj T* (2. )Tj/F2 8 Tf (Preserving Topology:)Tj/F1 8 Tf ( Using `--no-ff` ensures the feature branch lifespan is recorded, providing traceability during audits.)Tj T* (3. )Tj/F2 8 Tf (Webhook Efficiency:)Tj/F1 8 Tf ( Push webhooks execute instantly upon push, eliminating the periodic CPU and network overhead of SCM polling.)Tj T* (4. )Tj/F2 8 Tf (Idempotent Deployment:)Tj/F1 8 Tf ( Container deployments must verify and unbind existing socket bindings to prevent port clash errors.)Tj T* (5. )Tj/F2 8 Tf (True Health Checks:)Tj/F1 8 Tf ( Validating HTTP JSON responses \(`/health`\) ensures runtime application health rather than just container daemon state.)Tj T* ET Q q .062745 .72549 .505882 RG 1 J 1 j 0 76 m 540 76 l S 0 0 m 540 0 l S 0 0 m 0 76 l S 540 0 m 540 76 l S Q Q q .007843 .517647 .780392 rg BT 9.6 TL/F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 762 Tm (LAB 1: DEVOPS FOUNDATIONS & CONTINUOUS INTEGRATION)Tj T* ET .392157 .454902 .545098 rg BT/F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 471.08 762 Tm (Academic Submission Report)Tj T* ET .796078 .835294 .882353 RG .5 w 36 756 m 576 756 l S 36 36 m 576 36 l S BT/F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 24 Tm T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 535.08 24 Tm (Page 3 of 3)Tj T* ET Q Q
endstream
